# NOTE (bootstrap maintainers): never add .serena/, raw/, or wiki/ here.
# Gitignoring them blinds Serena (ignore_all_files_in_gitignore: true) and
# Claude Code's Grep. merge-gitignore.sh offers them via .git/info/exclude
# instead — same git semantics, invisible to Serena. Ripgrep-class walkers and
# Claude Code's @ file picker do honor info/exclude, so install-global.sh
# registers a fileSuggestion picker that re-includes the sentinel-scoped paths.
# See wiki/knowledge/concepts/git-ignore-tool-visibility.md.
